      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RAD RIPPER (2) has a superb record at this track and trip, unbeaten so far from three starts. In the money last time at Angle Park (30.52) in a Special conditions race, finishing a 5 length third. Has the ability and should feature. ASTON MICHELLE (8) is rarely far away but tends to find one better, placing six from 11 starts. Hit the board with a minor placing last time when second (29.92) at this track. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Must be included in calculations. ASTON SAFARI (5) stuck on well last time to finish 0.8 lengths back in second (30.04) at this track in a Novice race over 520m. Overdue and gets his chance. MOON SHADOW (1) must be respected despite an unplaced effort here most recently.",
